</li><li id=\"menu-4513-1\" class=\"last odd sf-item-5 sf-depth-3 sf-no-children\"><a href=\"/resources/financial-aid-and-scholarships/usa\" class=\"sf-depth-3\">US Colleges &amp; Universities</a></li></ul></li><li id=\"menu-4523-1\" class=\"middle odd sf-item-3 sf-depth-2 sf-no-children\"><a href=\"/resources/financing-your-post-secondary-education-us-focused\" class=\"sf-depth-2\">Financial Aid Information</a></li><li id=\"menu-4517-1\" class=\"middle even sf-item-4 sf-depth-2 sf-no-children\"><a href=\"/resources/global-scholarship-competitions\" class=\"sf-depth-2\">Global Scholarship Competitions</a></li><li id=\"menu-4520-1\" class=\"middle odd sf-item-5 sf-depth-2 sf-no-children\"><a href=\"/resources/organizations-programs-africa\" class=\"sf-depth-2\">Organizations &amp; Programs in Africa</a></li><li id=\"menu-4519-1\" class=\"middle even sf-item-6 sf-depth-2 sf-no-children\"><a href=\"/resources/post-graduategap-year-alternative-schools\" class=\"sf-depth-2\">Post-Grad/Gap Year Opportunities</a></li><li id=\"menu-4521-1\" class=\"last odd sf-item-7 sf-depth-2 sf-no-children\"><a href=\"/resources/useful-links-additional-materials\" class=\"sf-depth-2\">Useful Links &amp; Resources</a></li></ul></li><li id=\"menu-2101-1\" class=\"middle odd sf-item-7 sf-depth-1 sf-total-children-1 sf-parent-children-0 sf-single-children-1 menuparent\"><a href=\"/employment\" class=\"sf-depth-1 menuparent\">Employment</a><ul><li id=\"menu-4707-1\" class=\"firstandlast odd sf-item-1 sf-depth-2 sf-no-children\"><a href=\"/employment/instructional-staff-role\" class=\"sf-depth-2\">Instructional Staff Role</a></li></ul></li><li id=\"menu-4816-1\" class=\"last even sf-item-8 sf-depth-1 sf-no-children\"><a href=\"/give\" class=\"sf-depth-1\">Give</a></li></ul>    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n    </nav>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"zone-content-wrapper\" class=\"zone-wrapper zone-content-wrapper clearfix\">  <div id=\"zone-content\" class=\"zone zone-content clearfix container-12\">\n          <div id=\"breadcrumb\" class=\"grid-12\"><nav class=\"breadcrumb\" role=\"navigation\" aria-label=\"You are here\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a><span class=\"tic\"> > </span><a href=\"/resources\">Resources</a><span class=\"tic\"> > </span><a href=\"/resources/colleges-universities-give-financial-aid-and-scholarships-international-students\">Colleges & Universities that Give Financial Aid and Scholarships to International Students</a><span class=\"tic\"> > </span>Canadian Universities</nav></div>\n    \n    <div id=\"moved-sidenav-wrapper\" class=\"moved-sidenav-wrapper grid-12\">\n       <div id=\"moved-sidenav\" class=\"moved-sidenav\" data-set=\"append-sidenav\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n        <div class=\"grid-9 push-3 region region-content\" id=\"region-content\">\n  <div class=\"region-inner region-content-inner\">\n    <a id=\"main-content\" tabindex=\"-1\"></a>\n                <h1 class=\"title\" id=\"page-title\">Canadian Universities that Give Financial Aid to International Students\n</h1>\n                        <div class=\"block block-system block-main block-system-main odd block-without-title\" id=\"block-system-main\">\n  <div class=\"block-inner clearfix\">\n            \n    <div class=\"content clearfix\">\n      <div  about=\"/resources/canadian-universities-give-financial-aid-international-students\" typeof=\"foaf:Document\" id=\"node-page-190\" class=\"ds-2col-fluid node node-page view-mode-full node-published node-not-promoted node-not-sticky author-101 odd clearfix group-one-column clearfix\">\n\n  \n      <div class=\"group-left\">\n      <div class=\"field field-name-body field-type-text-with-summary field-label-hidden\"><div class=\"field-items\"><div class=\"field-item even\" property=\"content:encoded\"><h2>Overview</h2>\n<p>Where to start: <a href=\"https://www.educanada.ca/index.aspx?lang=eng\">EduCanada</a></p>\n<h2><em><span>Need-based</span></em></h2>\n<p><strong><span>University of British Columbia</span></strong>:\u00a0<a href=\"http://you.ubc.ca/financial-planning/scholarships-awards-international-students/international-scholars/\"><span>International Leader of Tomorrow Award</span></a></p>\n<p><span>Wi</span><span>nners receive awards proportional to financial need as determined by tuition, fees and living costs minus the financial contribution you and your family can make annually. To be considered for the International Leader of Tomorrow award you must be admissible to the first choice degree you are applying to, have an excellent academic record, be a non-citizen or permanent resident of Canada, and demonstrate a level of financial need that would prevent you from pursuing a UBC degree.\u00a0\u00a0</span></p>\n<p><span><em><strong>and\u00a0</strong></em>the <a href=\"https://you.ubc.ca/financial-planning/scholarships-awards-international-students/international-scholars/\">Wehrung International Student Award</a></span></p>\n<p>The Donald A. Wehrung International Student Award is a need-based scholarship that recognizes outstanding international undergraduate students who have achieved academic excellence under difficult circumstances. To be considered for the award you must be neither a citizen nor a permanent resident of Canada; come from a war torn, politically unstable, or economically disadvantaged region of the world; unable to attend university without financial assistance; be graduating, or have recently graduated from secondary school; be applying for your first undergraduate degree; and be able to demonstrate superior academic achievement.\u00a0\u00a0</p>\n<hr />\n<h2><em><span>Merit based</span></em></h2>\n<p><strong><span>University of Toronto</span></strong><span>:\u00a0</span><a href=\"http://www.future.utoronto.ca/pearson/about\"><span>Pearson International Scholarship</span></a></p>\n<p><span>R</span><span>ecognizes outstanding international students who demonstrate exceptional academic achievement and creativity and who are recognized as leaders within their school. To become a Pearson Scholar you must be a non-Canadian requiring a study permit, and currently in your final year of secondary school or have graduated no earlier than June of the previous year. The scholarship provides full funding for 4 years for all successful applicants. All applicants must be nominated by their schools.</span></p>\n<p><strong><span>York University</span></strong>:\u00a0<a href=\"http://futurestudents.yorku.ca/funding#intl\"><span>Global Leader of Tomorrow Scholarship</span></a></p>\n<p><span>Awards $80,000 ($20,000 x 4). Scholarship is renewable for three years of full-time undergraduate study, provided high academic standing is maintained in each academic year. To be considered, you must be an international student who is required to have a Study Permit to study in Canada; be applying directly from high school no more than two years after graduation and have no previous university or college studies; have applied to an undergraduate degree program under the following faculties: Arts, Media, Performance &amp; Design; Environmental Studies; Education; Glendon; Health; Lassonde School of Engineering; Liberal Arts &amp; Professional Studies; Science; or the Schulich School of Business; and possess an excellent academic record (\u201cA\u201d average or equivalent) and have demonstrated leadership through community service or excellence in the arts, sports or other areas of individual achievement.</span></p>\n<p><span><strong><em>and </em></strong><em>the</em>\u00a0<a href=\"http://futurestudents.yorku.ca/funding#intl\">International Entrance Scholarship</a></span></p>\n<p>Awards $140,000 ($35,000 x 4). Scholarship is renewable for three years of full-time undergraduate study, provided high academic standing is maintained in each academic year. To be considered, you must be an international student who is required to have a Study Permit to study in Canada; be applying directly from high school no more than two years after graduation and have no previous university or college studies; have applied to an undergraduate degree program under the following faculties: Arts, Media, Performance &amp; Design; Environmental Studies; Education; Glendon; Health; Lassonde School of Engineering; Liberal Arts &amp; Professional Studies; Science; or the Schulich School of Business; and possess an excellent academic record (\u201cA\u201d average or equivalent) and have demonstrated leadership through community service or excellence in the arts, sports or other areas of individual achievement.</p>\n</div></div></div>    </div>\n  \n  \n</div>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n      </div>\n</div>\n<div  class=\"grid-3 pull-9 region region-sidebar-first sidebar yale-standard-sidebar\" id=\"region-sidebar-first\">\n  <div class=\"region-inner region-sidebar-first-inner\">\n    <div class=\"original-sidenav\" data-set=\"append-sidenav\">\n  <div id=\"additional-nav\" class=\"addnav-ready\">\n    <span class=\"additional-nav-button\"><a id=\"additional-nav-button\" role=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\" tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"ready\">Additional Navigation</span><span class=\"close\">Close</span></a></span>\n\n<nav class=\"block block-menu-block block-1 block-menu-block-1 odd has-subject\" id=\"block-menu-block-1\" role=\"navigation\" aria-label=\"Resources\">\n  <div class=\"block-inner clearfix\">\n              <h2 class=\"block-title\">Resources</h2>\n        \n    <div class=\"content clearfix\">\n      <div class=\"menu-block-wrapper menu-block-1 menu-name-main-menu parent-mlid-0 menu-level-2\">\n  <ul class=\"menu\"><li class=\"first leaf menu-mlid-4518 menu-application-&amp;-test-prep-materials\"><a href=\"/resources/application-resources-test-preparation-materials\">Application &amp; Test Prep Materials</a></li>\n<li class=\"expanded active-trail menu-mlid-4702 menu-colleges-&amp;-universities-that-give-financial-aid-and-scholarships-to-international-students\"><a href=